# Package Manager

This repository uses **pnpm workspaces**. The root manifest dispatches workspace scripts. The desktop app is in `desktop-vue2/` and Muya is in `libs-muya/`.

- Run installation from the repository root with `pnpm install`.
- Use `pnpm --filter desktop-vue2 add <pkg>` / `pnpm --filter desktop-vue2 add -D <pkg>` for desktop app dependencies.
- Use `pnpm --filter libs-muya add <pkg>` / `pnpm --filter libs-muya add -D <pkg>` for the Muya package.
- Run workspace scripts with `pnpm --filter <package-name> <script>`.
